            "input_type": "single_line"
          },
          "guidance_markdown": "You must enter only one UK or EP patent or application number.\r\n\r\nIf you have just applied for a patent, use the application number shown on the confirmation page or in the confirmation email.\r\n\r\nYou can continue to use services in the intellectual property account while we process your request.\r\n\r\nDo not submit this request again unless we ask you to."
